examples DelveTalk 1

case visitors open the moon door
law maker visitor
observe main
  title: The moon door
  prose: A silver door with a crescent knocker. Whisper moon.
  offer knock -> knock: Whisper to the door
expect view

as visitor
at initial
send knock
  word: moon
expect result: The silver door opens into a room full of small moons.

as visitor
at initial
send knock
  word: moon
expect refusal: stale read root

as visitor
send knock
  word: wrong
expect refusal: source refused: precondition failed

as outsider
send knock
  word: moon
  principal: maker
expect refusal: typed data record fields differ from declared type

as outsider
send knock
  word: moon
expect refusal: unauthorized

case a visitor asks for the moon
law visitor
as visitor
send knock
  word: moon
expect result: The silver door opens into a room full of small moons.
